# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and secrets
#   .env.example IS committed; every real .env file is not.
#   LTI tool private keys are secrets and never enter the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/fixtures/**/*.example.pem
secrets/
# Canvas platform registrations (LTI_PLATFORMS_FILE). Names a specific
# institution's Canvas and its developer key client id — configuration, not
# code (task 1.2).
lti-platforms.json
lti-platforms.*.json
# The tool's own RSA private keys (LTI_TOOL_KEY_DIR). *.key and *.pem above
# already cover the files; this covers the directory (task 1.3).
lti-keys/

